      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write an improved version of the test with better understandability — removing unused imports and adding comments that explain the intent of each assertion.Now I'll compile-check the test.The improved test compiles successfully. The refactored version removes six unused imports and adds inline comments that explain the intent of each assertion — why `assertNotSame` matters (each `get()` produces a fresh instance), what the default joiner does (no-separator concatenation), and how the StringBuilder accumulates content across two `join` calls."
